    "updated_at": "2023-03-03T18:13:08Z",
    "body": "The problem is that if a node is not in the flat tree at all, things like\r\n\r\n> Set currentNode to currentNode's parent in the [flat tree](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scoping/#flat-tree).\r\n\r\nare undefined behavior. Maybe we could fix that by having better definitions for flat-tree walking. Hmm.",
