    "updated_at": "2023-03-06T22:12:05Z",
    "body": "I also used the flat tree in these non-popover places which should be considered:\r\n- details auto expanding:\r\n  - https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/6466\r\n  - https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#ancestor-details-revealing-algorithm\r\n- hidden until found expanding:\r\n  - https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7475\r\n  - https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#ancestor-hidden-until-found-revealing-algorithm\r\n\r\nBoth of these are also implemented using the flat tree in chromium. It is probably safe to change if that's what we want to do.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/1457088255/reactions",
